<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Holy Touch</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Paladin (guild level 100)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast holy touch &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast holy touch</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The paladin speaks the liturgy of the gods and touches the target, which 
wounds those who lean to evil. Any target whose alignment is below neutral 
can be struck, and the truly evil are hurt more; on the good and the 
neutral, nothing happens. The better your divine power and sphere, the 
more it hurts. It does about as well against any armour, and being a 
touch, a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls. 
Stronger prayers follow: holy grasp and holy shout.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Word</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Grasp</a>
